Dubai Open Data Licence
https://data.dubai/documents/d/guest/open-data-license-english-1-1-pdf

The files in this repository are compiled from Dubai Land Department (DLD) open data.
They are offered under the same terms as the source data: the Open Data Licence
published by the Dubai Data and Statistics Establishment at the address above.
No additional or different terms are imposed.

In short, and subject to the licence text itself: you may use, adapt and share the
data for commercial and non-commercial purposes; you must not present it in a
misleading way; and it is provided as-is, with no warranty.

